# Design System & Shopkeeper Aesthetics

The Cashvio marketing site features a distinctive "Shopkeeper's Ledger & Thermal Receipt" visual identity integrated with Tailwind CSS v4 CSS-first theming.

## Invariant Rules

- **Brand Primary Hue**: Emerald brand primary (`#059669` light, `#10b981` dark). Never introduce arbitrary neon accents or mismatched hues.
- **Surface Foundations**:
  - Light mode: Warm vintage ledger paper (`#faf9f7` background, `#f2efe9` muted card surface, `#e2ddd5` border).
  - Dark mode: Emerald-tinted dark surfaces (`#0a1410` background, `#111d17` paper surface, `#24352c` border).
- **CSS-First Theming**: Semantic tokens are declared in `src/app/globals.css` with CSS variables and mapped via `@theme inline`. Never hardcode raw hex colors in component `.tsx` files.
- **Thermal Receipt Aesthetics**:
  - Scalloped edges (`.receipt-edge`, `.receipt-edge-top`).
  - Perforated tear lines (`.tear-line` with repeating dashed dasharray).
  - Dot matrix / monospaced numerals via `var(--font-plex-mono)` and `.receipt-font`.
  - Rubber stamp badges (`.stamp-badge` with `-3deg` tilt and dashed emerald border).
- **Icons**: Use pure, lightweight inline SVGs or Lucide icons matching the 24px/20px system grid.

## ❌ FORBIDDEN vs ✅ REQUIRED

### 1. Color Tokens & Surface Classes

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Hardcoded hex colors and generic slate backgrounds
<div className="bg-[#f8f9fa] border border-[#e5e7eb] text-[#111827]">
  <span className="text-[#00c853]">Free Forever</span>
</div>

// ✅ REQUIRED — Semantic Tailwind tokens mapped to theme variables
<div className="bg-surface border border-border text-foreground">
  <span className="text-primary font-medium">Free Forever</span>
</div>
```

### 2. Receipt Badges & Mono Annotations

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Generic round chip with arbitrary padding
<div className="rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-3 py-1">
  POINT OF SALE
</div>

// ✅ REQUIRED — Shopkeeper ledger mono eyebrow
<div className="mono-label tracking-widest text-muted-foreground uppercase text-[11px] font-mono">
  NO. 01 · POINT OF SALE
</div>
```

### 3. Responsive Layout Patterns

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Desktop-first or rigid px container layout
<div style={{ width: '1200px' }}>
  <div className="float-left w-1/2">...</div>
</div>

// ✅ REQUIRED — Mobile-first responsive grid with max-w-7xl
<div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
    {/* Cards */}
  </div>
</div>
```

## Shared UI Primitives

| Component | Location | Usage |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `Button` | `@/components/ui/button` | Primary (`default`), `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost` |
| `Card` | `@/components/ui/card` | Flat card surface with 1px border and optional subtle shadow |
| `Badge` | `@/components/ui/badge` | Small categorical label with mono or standard styling |
| `LedgerHero` | `@/components/marketing/ledger-hero` | High-converting page hero with receipt preview |
| `PrinterReceipt` | `@/components/marketing/printer-receipt` | Live animated thermal receipt paper with scalloped edge |
| `ComparisonTable` | `@/components/marketing/comparison-table` | Feature comparison table against generic alternatives |
| `ThemedShot` | `@/components/ui/themed-shot` | Dual-mode light/dark screenshot renderer |
